#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:5 9bddbd17e0774ea1b410a94d8fd46814
msgid "Video Stabilization Using IMU data and Gyroflow"
msgstr "使用 IMU 数据和 Gyroflow 进行视频稳像"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:7 6435dcb0d9624e41a3ab139f74389107
msgid ""
"ArduPilot provides the means to produce the log data needed for use with "
"`Gyroflow Video Stabilization software <https://gyroflow.xyz/>`_. This "
"software allows the post processing of video taken during a flight with the "
"IMU data logged during the flight to obtain stabilized video."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 提供了生成 `Gyroflow 视频稳像软件 <https://gyroflow.xyz/>`_ "
"所需日志数据的功能。该软件可将飞行过程中拍摄的视频与飞行日志中记录的 IMU 数据进行后期处理，从而获得稳定的视频。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:12 47f3902e15854052a6ad8d89272f5463
msgid "ArduPilot Setup"
msgstr "ArduPilot 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:14 134b6e540256456b8ec8d179cc3a16e9
msgid "The following parameters are required:"
msgstr "需要设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:16 9d10fb5a6adf4cc5a3eb49e0b278a7f0
msgid ""
"The Video Stabilization bit in :ref:`LOG_BITMASK<LOG_BITMASK>` (bit 20 for "
"Copter/Rover, 21 for Plane) must be set (1048576 (Copter/Rover) or 2097152 "
"(Plane) added to present value if not already set) to enable the proper "
"logging"
msgstr ""
"必须设置 :ref:`LOG_BITMASK<LOG_BITMASK>` 中的视频稳像位（Copter/Rover 为第 20 位，Plane 为第 "
"21 位）（如未设置，则在当前值上加 1048576（Copter/Rover）或 2097152（Plane））以启用正确的日志记录。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:18 ea2420fa649d4a18be9f17aa5974d67b
msgid ""
":ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` should be set to 300Hz or higher. "
"Planes and Rovers have 50Hz as a default and this should be raised. "
"QuadPlanes and Copters have it already set by default."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` 应设置为 300Hz 或更高。固定翼和 Rover 的默认值为 "
"50Hz，需提高。QuadPlane 和 Copter 已默认设置好。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:20 8ea8806f64e748fd80e2a996eeed5fde
msgid ""
"Optional: for ease of use, set :ref:`LOG_FILE_DSRMROT<LOG_FILE_DSRMROT>` = 1"
" to stop logging when disarmed. This allows multiple logs to be generated "
"for multiple flights during a session and makes syncing the logs to the "
"videos easier. Otherwise you would have one big log for multiple flights and"
" videos while powered up."
msgstr ""
"可选：为便于使用，设置 :ref:`LOG_FILE_DSRMROT<LOG_FILE_DSRMROT>` = "
"1，以在上锁时停止记录日志。这样每次飞行都会生成单独的日志，便于将日志与视频同步。否则，在整个上电期间会产生一个包含多次飞行和视频的大日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:22 d13b8f4d5d1846d3a872dca5ecbe027f
msgid ""
"Be sure to start the video and arm to start logging at very close to the "
"same time, otherwise you will need to determine the time offset between them"
" and use it for the synchronization dialog's \"Rough gryo offset\" value in "
"Gyroflow."
msgstr ""
"请确保视频录制和解锁（开始日志记录）几乎同时进行，否则需要确定两者之间的时间偏移，并在 Gyroflow 同步对话框的「Rough gyro "
"offset」值中使用该偏移量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:25 79d3bc231c084290b9ca13663f68a98f
msgid "Gyroflow Use"
msgstr "Gyroflow 使用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:27 f82db4cf61524e0da3389f91defb3a87
msgid ""
"Many tutorials exist on YouTube on how to use and adjust Gyroflow, but here "
"is a simplified quickstart for use with ArduPilot, assuming you have "
"installed Gyroflow:"
msgstr ""
"YouTube 上有许多关于如何使用和调整 Gyroflow 的教程，以下是配合 ArduPilot 使用的简化快速入门（假设已安装 "
"Gyroflow）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:29 ada9d051ef60474c92484d9a175c1c0c
msgid ""
"Download the flight log corresponding the video you wish to stabilize. In "
"Mission Planner, under the DataFlash tab, use the .bin to .log button to "
"convert the log .bin file to a .log file."
msgstr ""
"下载与待稳像视频对应的飞行日志。在 Mission Planner 的 DataFlash 标签页中，使用 .bin 转 .log 按钮将日志 .bin"
" 文件转换为 .log 文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:30 7884bf93164b4852983f4737e2100732
msgid "Start Gyroflow program."
msgstr "启动 Gyroflow 程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:31 b96a567303d742999205d49d4c40c02c
msgid "Open video file in Gryoflow"
msgstr "在 Gyroflow 中打开视频文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:32 5b0908eb19244eaf99d2e745906fc8bc
msgid ""
"Select the lens profile for your camera. If it is not listed (unlikely) the "
"there are tutorials  on YouTube as to how to calibrate for your camera."
msgstr "选择相机的镜头配置文件。如果列表中没有（不太可能），YouTube 上有关于如何为您的相机进行校准的教程。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:33 bd4c3552b45c48258995961017fe7467
msgid "Open the .log file you created in the first step above."
msgstr "打开上一步骤中创建的 .log 文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:34 42a306e32f164b609b3465e6c8d59006
msgid ""
"Be sure to enter the camera's rotation with respect to the autopilot. Its "
"very common to tilt the camera toward the earth for a better view on a "
"vehicle and this rotation MUST be precisely entered in the \"Rotation\" "
"input boxes in the log data section....typically -10 to -20 degrees."
msgstr ""
"务必输入相机相对于飞控的旋转角度。在飞行器上相机朝地倾斜以获得更好视野是非常常见的，这个旋转角度必须精确输入到日志数据部分的「Rotation」输入框中……通常为"
" -10 到 -20 度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:35 5a5978a5e06b4c9e8f21d07fd0da3ca2
msgid ""
"use the AutoSync button to synchronize the data and video...the number of "
"points used depends on the video and data, but is easily experimented with. "
"Starting with 4, for example."
msgstr "使用 AutoSync 按钮同步数据与视频……使用的同步点数量取决于视频和数据，可以通过实验确定，例如从 4 个点开始。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:37 500e597362fa49eea0e4cc3188287f9e
msgid ""
"You should be able to play a preview of stabilized video at this point and "
"experiment with the other stabilization settings..."
msgstr "此时应该可以预览稳像后的视频，并可以尝试其他稳像设置……"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gyroflow.rst:39 aca637c29fa943c5bafb302cb4d698a4
msgid ""
"if you are getting \"jello\" (CMOS cameras) that you cant remove in the "
"Gyroflow processing, it might be better to hard mount your camera, and maybe"
" get more even more jello in the raw video. The reason is that when soft "
"mounting the camera, it experiences different G-forces than what the "
"autopilot is recording and, therefore Gyroflow, cant compensate. Of course, "
"in some cases the end product can be even worse, so mounting experimentation"
" for your particular setup may be required."
msgstr ""
"如果出现 「果冻效应」（CMOS 相机）且在 Gyroflow "
"处理中无法消除，最好将相机硬挂，原始视频中可能会出现更多果冻效应。原因是软挂相机时，它受到的 G 力与飞控记录的不同，因此 Gyroflow "
"无法补偿。当然，某些情况下最终效果可能更差，因此可能需要针对您的具体安装方式进行挂载实验。"
